---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="HTTP API" description="RelayCore REST API reference">
  <h1>HTTP API</h1>

  <p>Enable the REST API with <code>relay-core-cli run --api-port 8082</code>. Default base URL: <code>http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/</code>. Optional <code>--api-token</code> enables Bearer auth.</p>

  <h2>Version &amp; Status</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/version</h3>
  <p>Server and API version info.</p>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/status</h3>
  <p>Runtime lifecycle snapshot.</p>

  <h2>Flows</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/flows</h3>
  <p>Search and paginate captured flows.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-get">GET</span>
    <span>/api/v1/flows?method=GET&amp;host=api.example.com&amp;limit=10&amp;offset=0</span>
  </div>

  <p><strong>Query Parameters:</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li><code>host</code>, <code>path</code>, <code>path_contains</code>, <code>method</code></li>
    <li><code>status_min</code>, <code>status_max</code>, <code>has_error</code>, <code>is_websocket</code></li>
    <li><code>limit</code> — Page size (default 50, max 200)</li>
    <li><code>offset</code> — Pagination offset</li>
  </ul>

  <pre><code>&#123;
  "items": [&#123; "id": "fld_...", "method": "GET", "path": "/users", "status": 200 &#125;],
  "returned": 10,
  "limit": 50,
  "offset": 0
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/flows/:id</h3>
  <p>Full Flow JSON including headers and bodies.</p>

  <h3>POST /api/v1/flows/:id/replay</h3>
  <p>Replay a captured flow.</p>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/flows/:id/har</h3>
  <p>Export a single HAR entry.</p>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/flows/export/har</h3>
  <p>Batch HAR export (same query params as search).</p>

  <h2>Rules</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/rules</h3>
  <p>List all interception rules.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-get">GET</span>
    <span>/api/v1/rules</span>
  </div>

  <h3>PUT /api/v1/rules</h3>
  <p>Create or update a rule.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-put">PUT</span>
    <span>/api/v1/rules</span>
  </div>

  <pre><code>&#123;
  "id": "rul_01HX5K9P3Q8Y2Z7",
  "name": "Log API requests",
  "priority": 100,
  "filter": &#123;
    "method": "GET",
    "host": "*.example.com",
    "path": "/api/*"
  &#125;,
  "action": &#123;
    "type": "log"
  &#125;,
  "enabled": true
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h3>DELETE /api/v1/rules/:id</h3>
  <p>Delete a rule.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-delete">DELETE</span>
    <span>/api/v1/rules/rul_01HX5K9P3Q8Y2Z7</span>
  </div>

  <h3>POST /api/v1/mock</h3>
  <p>Quickly create a MockResponse rule.</p>

  <h2>Intercepts</h2>

  <h3>POST /api/v1/intercepts</h3>
  <p>Create a one-shot intercept breakpoint.</p>

  <pre><code>&#123;
  "url_pattern": "api.example.com",
  "phase": "request"
&#125;</code></pre>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/intercepts</h3>
  <p>List pending intercepts.</p>

  <h3>POST /api/v1/intercepts/:key/resume</h3>
  <p>Resume an intercepted flow (optional modification body).</p>

  <h2>Events</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/events</h3>
  <p>Server-Sent Events stream for real-time updates.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-get">GET</span>
    <span>/api/v1/events</span>
  </div>

  <p>Event types: <code>flow::new</code>, <code>flow::update</code>, <code>intercept::pending</code>, <code>rule::matched</code></p>

  <h2>Metrics</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/metrics</h3>
  <p>JSON metrics snapshot.</p>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/metrics/prometheus</h3>
  <p>Prometheus text format metrics.</p>

  <pre><code># HELP relay_core_flows_total Total number of flows captured
# TYPE relay_core_flows_total counter
relay_core_flows_total 12847

# HELP relay_core_request_duration_ms Request duration in milliseconds
# TYPE relay_core_request_duration_ms histogram
relay_core_request_duration_ms_bucket&#123;le="1"&#125; 10023
relay_core_request_duration_ms_bucket&#123;le="5"&#125; 12500
relay_core_request_duration_ms_bucket&#123;le="10"&#125; 12800
relay_core_request_duration_ms_bucket&#123;le="+Inf"&#125; 12847</code></pre>

  <h2>Audit</h2>

  <h3>GET /api/v1/audit</h3>
  <p>Query control-plane mutation audit log.</p>

  <div class="endpoint">
    <span class="method method-get">GET</span>
    <span>/api/v1/audit?since=2024-01-15T00:00:00Z</span>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
